# Project 1: Student Performance Analysis

## Project Overview
This project uses Microsoft Excel to organise and analyse student academic performance, marks and attendance.

## Skills Practised
- Dataset creation and data entry
- Excel formatting
- Relative and absolute cell references
- Formulas and calculations
- Flash Fill
- Conditional formatting
- Sorting and filtering
- Freeze Panes and Split Window
- Page layout and printing

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Excel

## Project Tasks
1. Created a student performance dataset.
2. Applied formatting and formulas.
3. Calculated bonus marks using absolute references.
4. Generated student codes using Flash Fill.
5. Applied conditional formatting.
6. Sorted and filtered student records.
7. Prepared the worksheet for printing.

## Learning Outcome
Practised essential Excel features for data organisation, analysis and reporting.
